  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 5925,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "In UniFi Cloud Key versions prior to `5.3.12`, `5.4.9` and `5.5.2`, the firmware is downloaded in a unprotected channel, with allow an attacker in an MitM scenario to interfere with the communication, and possibly modifying the firmware during an update. The versions `5.3.12`, `5.4.9` and `5.5.2` fix this problem by utilizing encrypted channel to download the firmware.",
